DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T180000
SUMMARY:Digital Series #13 — Moins d’administratif grâce à l’IA
LOCATION:Co-working La Bergerie\, Place du Midi 50\, Sion
DESCRIPTION:Valais SMEs see how AI agents can take over routine admin — c
 lient requests\, bookings\, contracts and follow-up — with a live tool d
 emo and a local case study from the Sion coworking space.\n\nOrganiser: Sw
 iss Digital Center / Fondation The Ark (with CCI Valais)\n\nDetails and re
 gistration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/digital-series-13-automatisa
 tion-ia-sion-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/digital-series-13-automatisation-ia-s
 ion-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sdsc-mlops-introduction-epfl-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261114T120410Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T170000
SUMMARY:AI in Production: Introduction to MLOps — Training at EPFL
LOCATION:EPFL\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:One-day SDSC training on designing\, deploying and operating ML
  systems at scale — version control\, CI/CD\, experiment tracking\, moni
 toring\, drift detection and automated retraining. Registration closes 24 
 September.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Data Science Center\n\nDetails and registra
 tion: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/sdsc-mlops-introduction-epfl-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/sdsc-mlops-introduction-epfl-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:built-with-lovable-lausanne-2-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261114T120410Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T213000
SUMMARY:Built with Lovable · Lausanne #2
LOCATION:Lausanne (address on registration)
DESCRIPTION:A 90-minute hands-on build where everyone ships a working web a
 pp with AI features using Lovable’s built-in models — no API keys or s
 eparate accounts — with mentors on hand\, then demos and drinks. Bring a
  laptop and an idea.\n\nOrganiser: Lovable Lausanne (Maxime Dumont)\n\nDet
 ails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/built-with-lovabl
 e-lausanne-2-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/built-with-lovable-lausanne-2-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
